# Sync queue overlay (no layout shift)

The IndexedDB mutation queue must stay visible. It must **not** change document flow. Do **not** add sonner, react-hot-toast, shadcn, Radix Toast, MUI, or any toast library. Steal their **overlay geometry** only.

This rule **overrides** `design.md` §10.3 (full-width 28px Global Status Strip) where they conflict. Patch §10.3 in the implementation PR. Per-set cell badges (`design.md` §10.1) stay backlog (`AGENTS.md`) — do not build them in this pass, and do not hide REJECTED / CONFLICTED / offline behind “syncing…”.

Screenshot of the bug: logging a set (or going offline) inserts a full-width `h-7` bar above PLAN/LOG and the session table jumps down; when the queue drains the bar unmounts and the table jumps up.

