`motion.div` in `App.tsx` wraps dashboard/session (often applies `transform`). `position:fixed` **inside** that tree can pin to the transformed ancestor and still interact with `overflow-hidden`. Do **not** put the overlay inside `<main>` or the session `motion.div`.

