## Product verdict

| Keep | Drop |
| :--- | :--- |
| Visible offline / syncing / rejected / conflict | In-flow or sticky full-width bar that changes `offsetTop` of PLAN/LOG |
| `data-testid="sync-status"` + `data-state` | Hiding idle as a 28px empty spacer “to prevent shift” |
| `ConflictReviewCard` + `WorkoutLockBanner` as they are (already overlay) | Merging conflict review into the tiny chip |
| Sidebar `Queue n` / `Live` / `Offline` | sonner / shadcn / MUI / Radix Toast as a dependency |
| Compact corner chip + spinner while flushing | Nested cards, hero, gradient orbs, heavy blur glass |
| Idle = **unmounted** (count 0) | Success toast required on ACK |
| Ink / existing hex (`#0A0A0A`, `#131313`, `#007AFF`, `#F5A623`, red) | New palette, `zinc-*` stacks, decorative shadows |

Naive “make the bar `position:sticky`” is **insufficient** (sticky occupies flow). Naive “always render `h-7` with empty inner” also fails the user request (still a strip; still steals 28px). The smallest change that matches the request: **unmount from AppShell flow; mount a `fixed` corner chip on the SyncProvider overlay layer.**

